          "**How aspirin prevents it**: low-dose aspirin irreversibly inhibits **platelet COX-1**, lowering thromboxane A2 while sparing endothelial prostacyclin, and improves placentation when started **before 16 weeks** while spiral artery remodelling is still in progress - later starts barely work. [ASPRE 2017]",
